まうのですが、可能であれば何卒よろしくお願い致します。\n\n【参考資料】\n・metanolia（イメージは幼女天使）\n参考資料 → https://twitter.com/Raviel_ow/status/1466921661165228034\n\n・koroma（イメージは幼女スコティッシュフォールド）\n参考資料 → https://vprof.me/@/koroma\n\n・yukimiya（イメージは青髪の雪のようなふんわり女の子）\n参考資料 → https://twitter.com/yukiusagiMoG/status/1356983093265981443\n\n・狐白うる（イメージは神の白狐女の子）\n参考資料 → https://twitter.com/kohaku_uru/status/1440450908454731779", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_kinnyyy/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/65ffc745/uploads/origins/18401219-f7ad-4431-a189-73c6fcdb9685?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c228203a9a9bdbc853446d3fab5f549d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/65ffc745/uploads/origins/18401219-f7ad-4431-a189-73c6fcdb9685?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c228203a9a9bdbc853446d3fab5f549d, https://si.imgix.net/65ffc745/uploads/origins/18401219-f7ad-4431-a189-73c6fcdb9685?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ecb843893411b2f17e0f5357219d464d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/65ffc745/uploads/origins/18401219-f7ad-4431-a189-73c6fcdb9685?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=baa4a9e02a1346672876dd9a535e49f6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@_kinnyyy/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/90906838/uploads/origins/ecfc8e69-5aa5-4cce-8072-5e95162e1218?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccent